tion-group:NodeGroups - The number of node groups for an Amazon ElastiCache replication group. elasticache:replication-group:Replicas - The number of replicas per node group for an Amazon ElastiCache replication group. neptune:cluster:ReadReplicaCount - The count of read replicas in an Amazon Neptune DB cluster.
